# CODEOWNERS — every PR auto-requests review from the owners listed.
#
# This file is in effect today as a *template* for branch-protection
# rulesets. The "Require review from Code Owners" branch-protection
# rule is what turns it from advisory into enforced. Until that rule
# is enabled, this file just creates auto-review requests.
#
# Per-area entries are deliberately listed even though they all map to
# the same owner — they make later expansion (or temporary delegation)
# trivial. Edit one line, not the policy.

# Default — covers anything not matched by a more specific entry below.
*                           @jwa91

